        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "71decc43-d030-5d95-bad8-1109a998c84b",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 350,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.030:block:3",
          "start": 208
        },
        "quote": "(3) It is unlawful for any person to erect, operate, or otherwise use any sign at a time, place, or manner that is prohibited by this chapter.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.030:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.030 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "99701648-693b-5133-99e3-f486edfca01c",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 678,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.030:block:4",
          "start": 351
        },
        "quote": "(4) The Planning and Development Director is authorized to interpret and execute the regulations of this chapter. Any person aggrieved by a decision of the Planning and Development Director regarding the administration of this chapter may appeal such decision to the Board of Zoning Appeals in accordance with Chapter 2.45 TMC.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.030:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.030 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "6ee5efce-19c3-5c35-8ec5-d57c221f4d2e",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 830,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.030:block:5",
          "start": 679
        },
        "quote": "(5) This chapter does not prohibit signs, sign locations, or sign characteristics that are permitted by an express requirement of State or Federal law.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.030:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.030 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "e74b8c2b-ce06-5d7c-aaf5-f4f82a18411f",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 909,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.030:block:6",
          "start": 831
        },
        "quote": "(b) Exemptions. The regulations of this chapter do not apply to the following:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.030:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.030 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "b4feb8df-8dd0-5238-96c3-f3036c8b8c9a",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1504,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.030:block:7",
          "start": 910
        },
        "quote": "(1) Signs that are not visible from a public street, highway, road, sidewalk, bicycle, pedestrian path, or similar public way unless the sign is visible from the property line of an adjoining lot or parcel. A sign is considered not visible where it is fully obstructed by natural changes in grade, buildings, or landscaping that provides a complete year-round visual barrier. “Fully obstructed” means that the signs are not visible at ground level from the edge of the public right-of-way or residential property line, or from the upper level of a residential building on an adjoining property.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.030:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.030 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "6dd42f99-2755-520f-9a36-b82bdeb1aa8f",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1634,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.030:block:8",
          "start": 1505
        },
        "quote": "(2) Signs intended to be read only from inside the property and containing copy of a size not readable from outside the property.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.030:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.030 block 9",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 9,
          "component_id": "271d8695-9ba0-5a4a-8cc5-38eb0506678e",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1756,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.030:block:9",
          "start": 1635
        },
        "quote": "(3) Signs located entirely within the interior of a building or structure, except as otherwise provided for window signs.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.030:block:9#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
