        "quote": "(4) Signs associated with the temporary use of a building or site, including buildings or sites undergoing construction, during the time of the temporary use.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.030:block:10#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
